---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Attorneys from "../components/Attorneys.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
---
<Layout title="Who We Are — ALSA Law" description="Meet the senior counsel at ALSA Law — practitioners from the highest levels of the Bar and government.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Who We Are"
    title="The people behind the practice."
    subtitle="Practitioners drawn from the highest levels of the Bar and government, bringing the full weight of their experience to every matter."
    image="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292203-757bb62b4baf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80"
    position="object-center"
  />
  <Attorneys hideHeader expandable />

  <!-- ░░ Our Approach — the boutique difference ░░ -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-cream text-navy-900">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
      <p class="text-gold-600 text-sm tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-4">Our Approach</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif leading-tight text-navy-900">The boutique difference.</h2>
      <span class="gold-divider"></span>
      <p class="text-navy-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-12">
        We built ALSA Law to practise differently. Clients come to us for the judgment of senior counsel, given directly and without the layers of a larger firm.
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="border border-navy-900/10 bg-white p-6 lg:p-8">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-gold-500 mb-3">01</div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-navy-900 mb-2">Senior counsel, personally</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 leading-relaxed">
            Every matter is led by a founding partner, from the first conversation to its resolution. The lawyer you meet is the lawyer who does the work, not a name on the door with the file handed down.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-navy-900/10 bg-white p-6 lg:p-8">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-gold-500 mb-3">02</div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-navy-900 mb-2">Deliberately focused</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 leading-relaxed">
            We take on a limited number of matters so each receives genuine senior attention. The work we deliver draws on decades of experience across corporate, commercial, and contentious matters. It is the kind of judgment that is earned over a career, not assembled for the pitch.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-navy-900/10 bg-white p-6 lg:p-8">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl text-gold-500 mb-3">03</div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-navy-900 mb-2">Candid from the outset</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy-600 leading-relaxed">
            Clients receive realistic, straight advice from the first meeting. We begin by understanding what you are actually trying to achieve, then set a strategy around it: judgment, not just hours.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
